            "flags": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0002",
            "en_US": "",
            "flags": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0003",
            "en_US": [
                "When work's finally over...{VAR BE01}\n",
                "When my thrown Poké Ball rocks three\n",
                "times and I hear that great “click\"...{VAR BE01}\n",
                "My life is full of things that give me joy!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0004",
            "en_US": [
                "I'm a battling Clerk ⑭!\n",
                "...But my Pokémon are weak."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0005",
            "en_US": [
                "Busy, busy!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "After I eat breakfast, I have to think\n",
                "about lunch.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "After eating lunch, I worry about dinner.\n",
                "Every day's the same. What a busy life!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0006",
            "en_US": [
                "Hey there, Trainer!\n",
                "Are your Pokémon healthy?{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Being healthy's the best, because when\n",
                "you're healthy, you can do anything!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0007",
            "en_US": [
                "...Grumble, grumble, grumble.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Should I change my Pokémon's moves,\n",
                "or should I change my Pokémon?{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Grumble, grumble..."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0008",
            "en_US": [
                "Castelia City has so many people!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Sometimes there are people who are only\n",
                "interested in themselves."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0009",
            "en_US": [
                "My favorite way to spend my lunch break\n",
                "is watching ships at the dock."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0010",
            "en_US": [
                "Working women are beautiful, and\n",
                "battling Pokémon are wonderful!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0011",
            "en_US": [
                "At the Battle Company, we welcome\n",
                "Trainers who are proud of their skills."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0012",
            "en_US": [
                "Next time, I'll do it! Next time, I want to\n",
                "eat a Casteliacone for sure!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_033_0013",
            "en_US": [
